@startuml CU-08
actor "Administrador / Gestor de catálogo" as Adm
boundary "«UI» Angular (admin)" as UI
control "«Controller» API /catalog/options" as Ctrl
entity "«Model» CatalogConfigService / Category, Size, Color" as Model

Adm -> UI : Abre gestión de catálogo y crea categorías
UI -> Ctrl : POST /catalog/options/categories
Ctrl -> Model : create_category(db, data)
Model --> Ctrl : CategoryRead
Ctrl --> UI : CategoryRead
UI --> Adm : Categoría creada (lista actualizada)

Adm -> UI : Crea tallas y colores
UI -> Ctrl : POST /catalog/options/sizes | /colors
Ctrl -> Model : create_size/color(db, data)
Model --> Ctrl : SizeRead / ColorRead
Ctrl --> UI : SizeRead / ColorRead

Adm -> UI : Consulta y corrige las opciones
UI -> Ctrl : PATCH /catalog/options/sizes/{id} | /colors/{id}
Ctrl -> Model : update_size/color(db, id, data)
Model --> Ctrl : SizeRead / ColorRead
Ctrl --> UI : SizeRead / ColorRead

Adm -> UI : Consulta el catálogo público
UI -> Ctrl : GET /catalog/options/sizes | /colors
Ctrl -> Model : list_sizes/colors(db)
Model --> Ctrl : list[SizeRead/ColorRead]
Ctrl --> UI : list[SizeRead/ColorRead]

@enduml